        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8368, Traditional Rectangular Double Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Emtek Double Cylinder Rectangular Deadbolt has a traditional look that makes it a great choice for classic homes. The rectangle shape keeps this front door lock from looking too old fashioned, but it still retains an elegance that shows off style with a nod to current trends. The Traditional Rectangular Double Cylinder Deadbolt will fit doors 1-1/2 inches thick to 2-5/8 inches thick with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. A double cylinder deadbolt, the latch is thrown and retracted by a key from bot the interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both exterior and the interior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Double Cylinder Rectangular Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass collar and rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with a extension collar for thin doors.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rectangular Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/2\" to 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
